<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><i><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">Hi&nbsp;{{{Quote.Freight_Contact_Name__c}}}</span></span></i><br />
<br />
<i><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;"><span style="color:black;">Thank you for requesting a quote from Qantas Freight. We have reviewed the information provided and are pleased to provide you with the attached quote. &nbsp;</span></span></span></i><br />
&nbsp;<br />
