		<li><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">Visit us at&nbsp;</span></span></span></i><a href="https://apac01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.qantasfreight.com.au%2F&amp;data=02%7C01%7Canabel.thomasse%40qantas.com.au%7C31c4c02cb6fb418a567e08d4c1d2c28d%7C74ea519d97924aa986d9b7cab8204ddd%7C1%7C0%7C636346558382503507&amp;sdata=saGL9p44RqX7hQf2ueooR%2Bmgj05WceZS7ZmDmhvLgoE%3D&amp;reserved=0"><i><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">www.qantasfreight.com.au</span></span></i></a>&nbsp;</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><b><u><span style="color:#e74c3c;"><i><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">Within 24hrs / prior to shipment departure, please email a copy of this quote and advise the Airway Bill (AWB) number on your booking to </span></span></i></span><a href="https://apac01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=freightsalessupport%40qantas.com.au&amp;data=02%7C01%7Canabel.thomasse%40qantas.com.au%7C31c4c02cb6fb418a567e08d4c1d2c28d%7C74ea519d97924aa986d9b7cab8204ddd%7C1%7C0%7C636346558382503507&amp;sdata=xsEmhwR%2BfkrX9xSWgM%2Bryj%2B9EgBpnOwaHFQsfka9hkg%3D&amp;reserved=0"><span style="color:#e74c3c;"><i><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">freightsalessupport@qantas.com.au</span></span></i></span></a></u></b>&nbsp;</li>
</ul>
<b><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">Note:</span></span></span></i></b><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;"> </span></span></span><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;"><b><u><span style="color:#c0392b;">Above </span><a name="_Hlk491869089"><span style="color:#c0392b;">process </span></a><span style="color:#c0392b;">is important to ensure the Spot Rate is applied. Credits cannot be issued if this process is not followed</span></u></b><span style="color:#c0392b;">.</span></span></span></i><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<b><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">For Special Lane pricing:</span></span></span></i></b>

<ul>
	<li><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">Please advise acceptance of these rates by return email within 7 days</span></span></span></i></li>
	<li style="margin-top:6.0pt;margin-right:0in;margin-bottom:0in;margin-bottom:.0001pt;"><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">Upon acceptance of these rates your account manager will advise the rates effective date (will either be 1<sup>st</sup> or 15<sup>th</sup> of the month)</span></span></span></i></li>
</ul>
<b><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">Note:</span></span></span></i></b><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">&nbsp;Special Lane pricing will not be valid in the system unless the above steps are completed</span></span></span></i><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<b><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">For Domestic quotes:</span></span></span></i></b><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;"> Pricing quote is exclusive of AWB Fee and Surcharges – refer to your rate card for details (if applicable)</span></span></span></i><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<b><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;">For International quotes:</span></span></span></i></b><i><span style="color:black;"><span style="font-family:arial,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:9.0pt;"> Pricing quoted is all inclusive of surcharges</span></span></span></i><br />
